    "title": "per_position_probability at chance 1.0 turns every air cell of the structure to glass",
    "source": "run/TESTING.md §5 per_position_probability に chance: 1.0 (対象記号の全マスが変わる); docs/jp/recipes/DECORATORS.md §1 per_position_probability; selftest/config/okmodular/structures/selftest_chance.json (50 '_' cells)",
    "machine": {
      "structure": "selftest_chance"
    },
    "inputs": [
      {
        "item": "minecraft:cobblestone",
        "amount": 1
      }
    ],
    "ticks": 60,
    "snapshots": {
      "air": {
        "from": [
