  {
    "id": "s5-payout-wait",
    "section": "5",
    "title": "A recipe held on full outputs for 60 ticks keeps its payout draw and pays it once emptied",
    "source": "run/TESTING.md §5 chance: 0.6 のレシピで出力先を満杯にして数十 tick 待つ (空けたら当たったまま払い出される); docs/jp/recipes/DECORATORS.md §3 抽選の仕組み (NOTE: 抽選はやり直しません); ProcessAgent#writeToNBT payoutDecided/payoutSucceeded. The recipe uses chance 1.0, not 0.6: a lost draw ends the run at once and never waits, so the waiting state would be missed about 4 runs in 10. ChanceRecipeDecorator still draws at 1.0 (a [0,1) value < 1.0) and ProcessAgent#payoutSucceeds still records the draw (same ruling as s2-payout-survives)",
    "machine": {
      "structure": "selftest_chance"
    },
    "inputs": [
      {
        "item": "minecraft:clay_ball",
        "amount": 1
      }
    ],
    "ticks": 130,
    "steps": [
      {
        "at": 5,
        "action": "fillOutputs",
        "item": "minecraft:dirt"
      },
      {
        "at": 30,
        "action": "recordNbt",
        "label": "before-wait"
      },
      {
        "at": 90,
        "action": "recordNbt",
        "label": "after-wait"
      },
      {
        "at": 91,
        "action": "clearOutputs"
      }
    ],
    "expect": [
      {
        "kind": "recipeStarted",
        "value": true,
        "from": 30,
        "to": 30
      },
      {
        "kind": "recipeStarted",
        "value": true,
        "from": 90,
        "to": 90
      },
      {
        "kind": "nbtEqual",
        "a": "before-wait",
        "b": "after-wait",
        "keys": [
          "processAgent.payoutDecided",
          "processAgent.payoutSucceeded"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "outputMatchesPayout",
        "item": "minecraft:flint",
        "label": "after-wait"
      }
    ]
  }
]
